    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏdā^grĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδαγρικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gouty</i>, <i>podagric</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum tot feminae podagricae calvaeque sint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 15, 3, 21</span></i>
			. — <i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏdā^grĭcus</span></b> ,
