			person</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 4, 24</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">podagrici pedibus suis maledicunt, chiragrici
					manibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 132</span></i>
			.</div>
